  <<external provider>>
}

TripsController ..> Trip : constructs and saves
TripsController ..> Account : finds owner traveler
TripsController ..> TripMember : creates owner membership
Account --> Traveler : has many
Trip --> TripMember : has many
TripMember --> Traveler : belongs to
TripsController ..> FetchTripCoverImageJob : enqueues cover retrieval
FetchTripCoverImageJob ..> Trip : stores cover image URL
FetchTripCoverImageJob ..> Pexels : searches photos
